  Segments:
  - Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 223c508b54a953dbbbdc66dfcd1bbc85, type: 3}
    Subtitles:
    - Start: 0.14
      End: 3.6645
      Chinese: "\u78C1\u5438\u62FC\u88C5\u673A\u5668\u4EBA\uFF0C\u968F\u76D2\u9644\u6709\u57FA\u7840\u73A9\u6CD5\u56FE\u518C\u3002"
      English: Each magnetic robot comes with a booklet of basic activities.
    - Start: 4.2456
      End: 9.6526
      Chinese: "\u4E0D\u5C11\u5B69\u5B50\u5728\u8BD5\u73A9\u65F6\u53D1\u73B0\u4E86\u65B0\u82B1\u6837\uFF0C\u56FE\u518C\u8FD8\u6765\u4E0D\u53CA\u6536\u5F55\u3002"
      English: Children at our demonstration counter have already found ways to play
        that haven't made it into the booklet yet.
    - Start: 10.1937
      End: 11.7755
      Chinese: "\u5468\u672B\u6B22\u8FCE\u5230\u73A9\u5177\u4E13\u67DC\uFF0C\u4EB2\u81EA\u8BD5\u8BD5\u3002"
      English: Come and try one this weekend.
    - Start: 12.2164
      End: 16.4619
      Chinese: "\u67DC\u53F0\u65C1\u8FD8\u4F1A\u5C55\u51FA\u5F80\u671F\u8BD5\u73A9\u7167\u7247\uFF01"
      English: Photos from earlier demonstrations will also be on display beside
        the counter.
